  "content": "\n\n<h1>幸運方塊</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-lucky-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ly-lucky-blocks?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"贊助\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/paypal-donate-ff5f5f?logo=paypal&color=blue\" alt=\"贊助\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/psNvZJe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📖 說明</h2>\n<p>這個資料包是我個人開發的「幸運方塊」版本，無需安裝任何材質包。它會利用新版遊戲的顯示實體（Display Entities）來呈現方塊外觀。開啟幸運方塊時，有機會獲得遊戲內任何物品、方塊或箱子戰利品；此外還可能觸發陷阱、取得武器與盔甲，甚至遭遇全副武裝的敵人。</p>\n<p>非常適合用於多人伺服器，進行幸運方塊競賽，或搭配各類地圖與冒險玩法！</p>\n<p>若想在主世界中隨機生成並尋找幸運方塊，請安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flucky-blocks-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">幸運方塊世界擴充套件</a>！  </p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🛠️ 合成配方</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wZnoTGU.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予幸運方塊：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot lucky_blocks:lucky_block</code></pre>\n<p>清除所有幸運方塊：</p>\n<pre><code>/function lucky_blocks:clear</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題</h2>\n<p>如有任何問題、錯誤或缺陷，請至 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 上贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個耗時、繁瑣且成本高昂的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，只需幾下點擊即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候技術支援與快速回應服務，讓問題不再阻礙你的遊玩體驗！有興趣嗎？我們為你準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器託管\"></p>",
